{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"The controller confirmed the read-context finding. I also found a separate recovery-ordering question: ordinary configuration application updates the Peer before publishing the batch’s visible applied index, but snapshot recovery publishes that index before calling `RestoreRemotes`. Since election eligibility reads the visible index, I’ll check whether scheduling or locking protects that interval.\n"}}
